{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/2605373f4830d1f377e7861201c3fa7ed7f78f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$991+993+995+997+999=5000-N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"324\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f84169d2c822355f3ddadd4113c52dfb58c4b0f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/c/71cd1135d8d93cce11e12516b60e8c5dce3b655e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/886746a71699e3474c0583922d33bbd455c0a69e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 991+993+995+997+999=5000-N \\\\ &amp;\\Rightarrow (1000-9)+(1000-7)+(1000-5)+(1000-3)+(1000-1) = 5000-N \\\\ &amp;\\Rightarrow 5\\times 1000-(1+3+5+7+9) = 5000 -N \\\\ &amp;\\Rightarrow 5000-25=5000-N \\\\ &amp;\\Rightarrow N=25\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{E}}.  \\end{align*}\" width=\"949\" height=\"122\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHS